  "title": "Shivas Kapoor: Conferred Honorary Doctorate by AMET University",
  "summary": "Shivas Kapoor, GM and Head of Crewing at Hafnia, has been conferred an Honorary Doctorate (Honoris Causa) by AMET University, Chennai, in recognition of his contributions to the global shipping industry and to maritime workforce development. The award will be presented at the University’s Annual Convocation Ceremony on 2 July 2026. AMET University is the […]",
